{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X的大块能直接交代当屏的状态、原因和心理变化，并把收回感受推进到实际失去、承认幸福确实发生过；Y的大字多是分散的关键词，提示情绪很有效，但单看大字较难完整还原因果主线，结尾也停留在对未来的不确定，没有真正落到失去后的痛楚。small、fine、load：X的小字比喻大多贴着当下的情绪和身体体验，补充性较好，感受也更集中在观众自身；Y的小字虽然有不少具体细节，却经常转去描写声部、歌声等音乐本身，因此small、fine选X；load选Y，因为高亮大字多为较短的自然短语，虽然数量偏多，但整体比X每屏几条较长的大块更容易在停留时间内扫完。concise判平：X反复写收回感受、防备失去和舍不得，Y也反复写害怕失去、希望被需要，双方都有一定回环；human选Y，整体更像日常叙述，X的“把投入压低”“提前出现的不舍”“实际面对它已经不能成为眼前的相处”等表达偏摘要腔或搭配生硬，虽然Y也有“忘了藏好喜欢”这样的不自然说法；综合选X，因为它对曲子核心的呈现更准确，大字主线也更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8abb7a95-0acf-43fa-b001-0d9340711275", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T150902187058Z", "elapsed_seconds": 446.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:16:28.829399+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b32c2c1fbd0de9b7a703f2f9252277fec01d0435943cd4b84297d10922ed206f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_s